Final output schema: {"$defs": {"PriceReference": {"additionalProperties": false, "properties": {"reference": {"title": "Reference", "type": "string"}, "price_field": {"enum": ["open", "high", "low", "close"], "title": "Price Field", "type": "string"}, "price": {"title": "Price", "type": "string"}, "source": {"$ref": "#/$defs/TriggerSource"}}, "required": ["reference", "price_field", "price", "source"], "title": "PriceReference", "type": "object"}, "Setup": {"additionalProperties": false, "properties": {"type": {"anyOf": [{"type": "string"}, {"type": "null"}], "default": null, "title": "Type"}, "trigger_status": {"anyOf": [{"enum": ["pending", "triggered", "present", "absent", "failed", "stale", "unknown"], "type": "string"}, {"type": "null"}], "default": null, "title": "Trigger Status"}, "signal_quality": {"anyOf": [{"enum": ["clear", "weak", "failed", "absent", "unknown"], "type": "string"}, {"type": "null"}], "default": null, "title": "Signal Quality"}, "location_assessment": {"anyOf": [{"enum": ["favorable", "neutral", "poor", "unknown"], "type": "string"}, {"type": "null"}], "default": null, "title": "Location Assessment"}, "no_trade_reason": {"anyOf": [{"enum": ["no_trigger", "poor_location", "weak_signal", "failed_breakout", "opposing_pressure", "insufficient_data", "timeframe_conflict", "stale_or_late", "missing_invalidation", "balanced_context"], "type": "string"}, {"type": "null"}], "default": null, "title": "No Trade Reason"}}, "title": "Setup", "type": "object"}, "Trigger": {"additionalProperties": false, "properties": {"reference": {"title": "Reference", "type": "string"}, "price_field": {"enum": ["open", "high", "low", "close"], "title": "Price Field", "type": "string"}, "price": {"title": "Price", "type": "string"}, "source": {"$ref": "#/$defs/TriggerSource"}, "kind": {"enum": ["market", "stop", "limit"], "title": "Kind", "type": "string"}, "direction": {"enum": ["at", "above", "below"], "title": "Direction", "type": "string"}}, "required": ["reference", "price_field", "price", "source", "kind", "direction"], "title": "Trigger", "type": "object"}, "TriggerSource": {"additionalProperties": false, "properties": {"timeframe": {"title": "Timeframe", "type": "string"}, "bar_index": {"minimum": 0, "title": "Bar Index", "type": "integer"}, "open_time_ms": {"minimum": 0, "title": "Open Time Ms", "type": "integer"}, "close_time_ms": {"minimum": 0, "title": "Close Time Ms", "type": "integer"}}, "required": ["timeframe", "bar_index", "open_time_ms", "close_time_ms"], "title": "TriggerSource", "type": "object"}}, "additionalProperties": false, "properties": {"schema": {"const": "brooks.trade-intent.v2", "title": "Schema", "type": "string"}, "role": {"const": "TRADER", "title": "Role", "type": "string"}, "decision": {"enum": ["ENTER_LONG", "ENTER_SHORT", "NO_TRADE"], "title": "Decision", "type": "string"}, "symbol": {"title": "Symbol", "type": "string"}, "decision_time_ms": {"minimum": 0, "title": "Decision Time Ms", "type": "integer"}, "market_context": {"anyOf": [{"additionalProperties": true, "type": "object"}, {"type": "null"}], "title": "Market Context"}, "setup": {"anyOf": [{"$ref": "#/$defs/Setup"}, {"type": "null"}]}, "decision_timeframe": {"anyOf": [{"type": "string"}, {"type": "null"}], "title": "Decision Timeframe"}, "context_timeframes_used": {"items": {"type": "string"}, "title": "Context Timeframes Used", "type": "array"}, "entry_mechanism": {"enum": ["continuation", "breakout", "breakout_pullback", "reversal", "none", "unclear"], "title": "Entry Mechanism", "type": "string"}, "trigger": {"anyOf": [{"$ref": "#/$defs/Trigger"}, {"type": "null"}]}, "invalidation": {"anyOf": [{"$ref": "#/$defs/PriceReference"}, {"type": "null"}]}, "evidence_for": {"items": {"type": "string"}, "minItems": 1, "title": "Evidence For", "type": "array"}, "evidence_against": {"items": {"type": "string"}, "minItems": 1, "title": "Evidence Against", "type": "array"}, "qualitative_confidence": {"enum": ["high", "medium", "low"], "title": "Qualitative Confidence", "type": "string"}, "uncertainty": {"items": {"type": "string"}, "minItems": 1, "title": "Uncertainty", "type": "array"}, "conditions_that_change_market_read": {"items": {"type": "string"}, "minItems": 1, "title": "Conditions That Change Market Read", "type": "array"}}, "required": ["schema", "role", "decision", "symbol", "decision_time_ms", "market_context", "setup", "decision_timeframe", "context_timeframes_used", "entry_mechanism", "trigger", "invalidation", "evidence_for", "evidence_against", "qualitative_confidence", "uncertainty", "conditions_that_change_market_read"], "title": "TradeIntentV2", "type": "object"}
Input: {"decision_time_ms": 1790323199999, "macro_contexts": {"D1": {"context": {"always_in": "long", "always_in_relevance": "medium", "breakout_mode": true, "confidence": "medium", "decision_time_ms": 1790294399999, "directional_pressure": "bull", "evidence_against": ["The strongest counterargument is that the trend keeps producing spiking highs that are not held: bar 86 reached 2771 with a 255.70-point upper tail and was followed by 27 sideways bars, and bar 117 now shows the same shape with high 2850 and close 2775.61 (74.39-point tail), so the current 'breakout' may be another overshoot rather than a durable spike.", "Trading-range behaviour dominates the window: bars 11-35, 50-83 and 87-113 are three multi-week ranges covering roughly 86 of 120 bars, so this market has repeatedly reverted to range after every strong leg, which weakens a trend-continuation label.", "The pullback is large relative to the leg: 216.69 points (~7.6%) from 2850 to 2633.31 in only three bars, and bar 119's low 2641.37 undercuts the low 2641.70 of the breakout bar 117, a sign that the spike's momentum is already being absorbed.", "The last 20 bars are only net +207 (bar 101 close 2479.28 to bar 120 close 2686.59) while containing both a new high 2850 and a deep dip to 2358.62 (bar 111), i.e., two-sided rather than one-directional pressure."], "evidence_for": ["Acceptance above a multi-week range: four consecutive closes (2612.02, 2632.98, 2642.90, 2775.61) above the 2557.46 top of the 27-bar bars 87-113 range, with a new window high at 2850 (bar 117).", "Swing progression is upward across the window: higher lows 1368.42 -> 1512.91 -> 1803.74 -> 2357.18 paired with higher highs 1944.39 -> 1974.46 -> 2771 -> 2850.", "The pullback after the breakout is being bought above the breakout level: bars 118-120 hold low 2633.31, and bar 120 closes 2686.59, 129 points above 2557.46 and in the upper 81% of its own 66.08 range.", "The 27-bar range (bars 87-113) resolved upward with follow-through bars 115 and 116 (closes 2632.98 and 2642.90) rather than immediately reversing, unlike the failed bar 61 (1974.46) and bar 107 (2680) probes inside earlier ranges."], "missing_information": [], "observations": ["Window covers 120 closed D1 bars from open 1779926400000 to the final close 1790294399999; window low is 1368.42 (bar 10, close 1780790399999) and window high is 2850 (bar 117, close 1789948800000), a 108% advance from low to high.", "Bars 6-10 are five consecutive lower closes (1859.02, 1813.04, 1731.00, 1581.32, 1568.55), breaking the bars 1-5 range of 1958.77-2042.37; bar 6 opens 2006.06 with high 2006.17 and closes 1859.02.", "Bar 10 prints the window low 1368.42 but closes 1568.55, a 200.13-point lower tail (87% of its 230.85 range) - a climactic reversal bar rather than a clean bear trend bar.", "Bars 11-35 are two-sided and overlapping between high 1845.09 (bar 19) and low 1512.91 (bar 30); bar 30's 1512.91 is a higher low versus 1368.42.", "Bars 36-49 rally from 1597.72 (bar 36 low) to 1944.39 (bar 49 high) with consecutive bull closes 1889.93 and 1917.02 (bars 48-49).", "Bars 50-83 form a 34-bar overlapping range between 1803.74 (bar 51 low) and 1974.46 (bar 61 high); bar 61 opens 1953.92, tags 1974.46 and closes 1891.41, and bars 73 and 80 have ranges of only 13.24 and 10.41 (doji cluster).", "Bars 84-86 are a bull spike: bar 84 opens 1916.51 with low 1905.63 and closes 2252.16; bar 86 prints high 2771 but closes 2515.30, leaving a 255.70-point upper tail.", "Bars 87-113 hold a 27-bar range between 2357.18 (bar 98 low) and 2557.46 (bar 92 high); bar 107 spikes to 2680 and closes 2514.72 back inside the range.", "Bars 114-117 close 2612.02, 2632.98, 2642.90 and 2775.61, all above the 2557.46 range high, and bar 117 reaches the new window high 2850.", "Bars 118-120 pull back from bar 118 high 2776.18 to bar 120 low 2633.31; bar 119's low 2641.37 undercuts bar 117's low 2641.70, and bar 120 closes 2686.59 (81% of its 66.08 range) still 129 points above the 2557.46 breakout level."], "phase": "breakout-spike", "primary_regime": "bull-trend", "role": "CONTEXT_ANALYST", "schema": "brooks.market-context.v2", "structures": [{"description": "Bear breakout of the bars 1-5 range 1958.77-2042.37, with five consecutive bear closes down to the 1368.42 low; bar 6 opens 2006.06 and closes 1859.02, bar 10 closes 1568.55.", "end_time_ms": 1780790399999, "kind": "breakout", "lower_boundary": "1368.42", "start_time_ms": 1780358400000, "upper_boundary": "2042.37"}, {"description": "Sell-climax reversal bar at the 1368.42 low: close 1568.55 with a 200.13-point lower tail, ending the bear spike and starting the basing process.", "end_time_ms": 1780790399999, "kind": "climax", "lower_boundary": "1368.42", "start_time_ms": 1780704000000, "upper_boundary": "1599.27"}, {"description": "Post-spike two-sided range with heavy overlap and alternating closes; high 1845.09 (bar 19), higher low 1512.91 (bar 30), roughly 1500-1850 area.", "end_time_ms": 1783036799999, "kind": "range", "lower_boundary": "1512.91", "start_time_ms": 1780790400000, "upper_boundary": "1845.09"}, {"description": "Bull leg from the 1597.72 low (bar 36) to the 1944.39 high (bar 49), continued by a pullback low of 1803.74 (bar 51).", "end_time_ms": 1784073599999, "kind": "swing", "lower_boundary": "1597.72", "start_time_ms": 1782950400000, "upper_boundary": "1944.39"}, {"description": "34-bar overlapping range between 1803.74 (bar 51 low) and 1974.46 (bar 61 high); the bar 61 probe above 1974.46 failed and closed 1891.41, and bars 73 and 80 are very small doji bars.", "end_time_ms": 1787097600000, "kind": "range", "lower_boundary": "1803.74", "start_time_ms": 1784160000000, "upper_boundary": "1974.46"}, {"description": "Bull spike out of the 1800-1975 range: bar 84 rises from 1916.51 to close 2252.16, and bar 86 spikes to 2771 before closing 2515.30 (buy climax with a 255.70-point upper tail).", "end_time_ms": 1787356799999, "kind": "breakout", "lower_boundary": "1905.63", "start_time_ms": 1787097600000, "upper_boundary": "2771"}, {"description": "27-bar range after the spike between 2357.18 (bar 98 low) and 2557.46 (bar 92 high); bar 107 overshoots to 2680 but closes 2514.72 back inside the range.", "end_time_ms": 1789689599999, "kind": "range", "lower_boundary": "2357.18", "start_time_ms": 1787356800000, "upper_boundary": "2557.46"}, {"description": "Four-bar breakout above the 2557.46 range top: closes 2612.02, 2632.98, 2642.90 and 2775.61, with bar 117 printing the window high 2850 (74.39-point upper tail).", "end_time_ms": 1789948800000, "kind": "breakout", "lower_boundary": "2436.87", "start_time_ms": 1789689600000, "upper_boundary": "2850"}, {"description": "Three-bar pullback from bar 118 high 2776.18 to bar 120 low 2633.31 that holds above the 2557.46 breakout level; bar 119's low 2641.37 undercuts bar 117's low 2641.70 and bar 120 closes 2686.59 near the top of its range.", "end_time_ms": 1790294399999, "kind": "swing", "lower_boundary": "2633.31", "start_time_ms": 1790035200000, "upper_boundary": "2776.18"}], "symbol": "ETH-USDT", "timeframe": "D1", "transition_conditions": ["Two or more consecutive closes above 2776.18 (bar 118 high) would confirm the bars 114-117 leg as a continuing spike and keep the read as bull breakout.", "A daily close back below 2557.46 (the bars 87-113 range top) would mark the breakout as failed and revert the primary read to trading-range with an upper boundary near 2850.", "A close below bar 120's low 2633.31 followed by a lower high below 2776.18 would shift the always-in to short and raise the higher-high MTR-like interpretation of 2771 versus 2850.", "Continued overlapping closes between roughly 2633 and 2776 with small bodies would move the phase from breakout-spike toward channel or range without changing the bullish regime label."], "window_bars": 120}, "freshness": "current"}, "H4": {"context": {"always_in": "unclear", "always_in_relevance": "low", "breakout_mode": true, "confidence": "medium", "decision_time_ms": 1790308799999, "directional_pressure": "balanced", "evidence_against": ["The 2850.00 high occurred on a single bar whose close 2723.15 sits 126.85 below that high, and roughly 20 bars of overlap between 2633.31 and 2804.59 have followed without a new high, which is at least as consistent with a buying climax and a trading range as with a continuing bull trend.", "Follow-through after the spike lasted one bar: bar 99 made 2795.00 but closed 2754.31, and the next push topped at 2804.59 (bar 101) before turning down, so there is no demonstrated acceptance above the spike level.", "Near-term closes tilt two-sided to slightly bearish: 2694.09, 2686.59, 2677.28 over the last three bars, with bar 116 breaking to a new range low 2633.31 and bar 111 printing a strong bear bar (2726.71 to 2659.00).", "Precedent in the same window: after the bar-39 spike to 2680.00 the market produced a six-bar bear leg to 2358.62 (bar 64), so a similar post-spike sideways phase has already resolved downward once here."], "evidence_for": ["Higher swing highs and higher swing lows govern the second half of the window: lows 2358.62 (bar 64) then 2569.80 (bar 90) then 2633.31 (bar 116); highs 2609.02 (bar 59) then 2643.52 (bar 82) then 2850.00 (bar 98).", "The window closes 2677.28 against an open of 2451.32, and price has held above the 2500-2528 zone that capped bars 1-38 for the whole post-bar-81 stretch.", "The largest-range bars in the second half close bullishly: bar 39 (2457.12 to 2555.52), bar 81 (2507.15 to 2578.60), bar 98 (2658.81 to 2723.15) and bar 99 (2723.15 to 2754.31).", "The post-spike pullback has been bought above the spike base: no bar since bar 100 has closed below 2633.31, and the lows at 2648.49 (bar 111), 2641.37 (bar 112) and 2633.31 (bar 116) were each followed by a close back near 2676-2682 (bars 112 and 117)."], "missing_information": [], "observations": ["Window opens at 2451.32 (bar 1, open_time_ms 1788580800000) and closes at 2677.28 (bar 120, open_time_ms 1790294400000): a net advance of about 226 points while the extreme low of the window is 2358.62 (bar 64, open_time_ms 1789488000000) and the extreme high is 2850.00 (bar 98, open_time_ms 1789977600000).", "Bars 1-38 hold a 2411.04 (bar 33 low) to 2528.80 (bar 12 high) overlapping range with repeated closes between 2460 and 2528; the largest bar in that stretch, bar 39 (open_time_ms 1789128000000), opens 2457.12, reaches 2680.00 and closes 2555.52, spiking out of the range.", "Bar 59 (open_time_ms 1789416000000) prints high 2609.02 but closes 2514.07 near its low, and bars 59-64 then fall to 2358.62, a bear leg of roughly 250 points in six bars including bar 63 (open 2475.02, low 2390.73, close 2423.29) and bar 64 (open 2423.22, low 2358.62, close 2412.95).", "The recovery from bar 64's low 2358.62 runs to 2643.52 (bar 82, open_time_ms 1789747200000) with bull closes, then pauses in a 2568-2645 overlap (bars 83-92) before bar 98 spikes again: open 2658.81, high 2850.00, close 2723.15, leaving a 126.85 upper tail; bar 99 (open_time_ms 1789992000000) reaches 2795.00 but closes 2754.31.", "Since bar 100 (open_time_ms 1790006400000) all bars have traded inside 2633.31 (bar 116 low) and 2804.59 (bar 101 high), about 171 points or roughly 6.4 percent wide, with heavy bar-to-bar overlap and a mid-point near 2719; the 2850.00 spike high has not been retested.", "Recent two-sided action: bar 111 (open_time_ms 1790164800000) opens 2726.71 and closes 2659.00 on a low of 2648.49; bar 112 closes 2676.47 above its open 2658.15; bar 116 breaks to 2633.31 and closes 2647.90; bar 117 closes 2682.25 above its open 2647.90; the last three bars close progressively lower at 2694.09, 2686.59 and 2677.28 with the latest high 2699.53 staying below bar 111's 2727.77 high.", "The final bar closes at 2677.28, near the middle of the 2633.31-2804.59 range, above every pre-spike level from bars 1-38 (the 2500-2528 congestion)."], "phase": "range", "primary_regime": "bull-trend", "role": "CONTEXT_ANALYST", "schema": "brooks.market-context.v2", "structures": [{"description": "Early overlapping range (bars 1-38) that capped price before the first spike; 2411.04 was the deepest low (bar 33) and 2528.80 the highest high (bar 12), with many closes clustered between 2460 and 2528.", "end_time_ms": 1789127999999, "kind": "range", "lower_boundary": "2411.04", "start_time_ms": 1788580800000, "upper_boundary": "2528.80"}, {"description": "Bear leg from bar 59's high 2609.02 to bar 64's low 2358.62, about 250 points in six bars, with weak closes (2514.07, 2497.77, 2472.88, 2475.01, 2423.29, 2412.95) and only shallow bounces.", "end_time_ms": 1789502399999, "kind": "swing", "lower_boundary": "2358.62", "start_time_ms": 1789416000000, "upper_boundary": "2609.02"}, {"description": "Bull spike / buying-climax bar 98: open 2658.81, high 2850.00, low 2658.06, close 2723.15, a roughly 192-point bar whose close sits in the lower third and leaves a 126.85 upper tail. The following bar reached 2795.00 but closed 2754.31, and no later bar has exceeded 2804.59.", "end_time_ms": 1789991999999, "kind": "climax", "lower_boundary": "2658.06", "start_time_ms": 1789977600000, "upper_boundary": "2850.00"}, {"description": "Post-spike trading range (bars 100-120) with heavy overlap between 2633.31 (bar 116 low) and 2804.59 (bar 101 high); the 2850.00 spike high stands above it and price closes mid-range at 2677.28.", "end_time_ms": 1790308799999, "kind": "range", "lower_boundary": "2633.31", "start_time_ms": 1790006400000, "upper_boundary": "2804.59"}, {"description": "Recent two-sided chop inside the range (bars 111-120): bar 111 bear bar closing 2659.00, bar 112 and bar 117 bull reversal closes (2676.47 and 2682.25), a 2633.31 low at bar 116, then three lower closes 2694.09, 2686.59, 2677.28 with the last high 2699.53 below the 2727.77 high of bar 111.", "end_time_ms": 1790308799999, "kind": "two-sided", "lower_boundary": "2633.31", "start_time_ms": 1790164800000